{
  "startedAt": "2026-10-12T14:48:07.015Z",
  "steps": [
    "Registered behavior JSON opens the independent editor; typed amount and signal alias are reviewed with exact BOM/CRLF source, then Cancel changes neither draft nor disk. Three languages at 390px retain approval, have no horizontal overflow, and keep Return/Check/Apply visible while the body scrolls.",
    "An unfinished numeric parameter survives switching bindings and a failed check in the actual browser. Cancel still leaves author bytes untouched.",
    "Apply changes only the current unsaved draft; ordinary editor Save writes the exact reviewed bytes. Reopening reads 65. Every other author document, registration, template and asset remains byte-identical.",
    "The saved authoring change drives a real Godot plan → build → headless run: first binding emits authoring_checkpoint with east/65, while the second still emits checkpoint with west/20.",
    "The resulting generated project is inspected, delivered through a real browser download, independently verified and extracted, then imported by real Godot at a new location. Scripts and image resources are present; no further author writes occur."
  ],
